RANGE COVERED:** September 6–23, 2026  \n**LANES UPDATED:** Job Search  \n**CANONICAL ITEMS FOUND:** 0 GCE Framework items  \n**PROJECT-CANONICAL ITEMS FOUND:** Later A-Tex job-search state and compensation interpretations, subject to Drive recon  \n**HISTORICAL ITEMS FOUND:** MHI-first ranking; ATEX relationship-only posture; old outreach state  \n**SUPERSEDED ITEMS FOUND:** Yes — job priority, relocation stance, MHI 401(k)/$320K assertions, A-Tex 3%/15% assumptions as facts  \n**ARTIFACTS / LOCATIONS:** Job Search Status & Interview Prep; two dedicated A-Tex Drive artifacts; A-Tex benefits guide; Oasis source; several chat-only artifacts  \n**GOOGLE DRIVE REFERENCES:** 3 priority job-search artifacts  \n**GOOGLE DRIVE MODIFIED:** **NO**  \n**CONFLICTS FOUND:** 4 meaningful supersession/reconciliation items  \n**OPEN ITEMS:** Exact Drive paths; latest A-Tex/MHI/Oasis/RF-SMART state to be reconciled from later evidence  \n**NEXT INTAKE:** Ready  \n**NEXT ROUTE:** Continue accumulation; do not perform full job-search Drive reconciliation prematurely  \n**DON INPUT NEEDED:** **NO**  \n**ANCHOR STATUS:** ACTIVE / REGISTRY ACCUMULATING CLEANLY"]}, "create_time": 1790198028.563639, "end_turn": true, "id": "410f9a30-6f9d-4081-85d3-6b70b961eae0", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [{"citation_format_type": "berry_file_search", "end_ix": 887, "metadata": {"extra": {"api_tool_source": "files/context_stuff", "authors_display": null, "cited_message_id": "5441c93a-257b-4156-82e5-df8525c9791a", "cited_message_idx": 51, "cloud_doc_url": null, "doi": null, "effective_time": null, "journal_homepage_url": null, "journal_name": null, "library_file_id": "libfile_cf6260d00bd08191acbd91262c2df55b", "line_range": [3, 11], "publication_year": null, "retrieval_file_index": 0, "retrieval_turn": 2, "run_id": null, "search_result_idx": null, "set_id": null, "source_icon_url": null, "source_label": null, "source_url": null, "spl_version": null, "title": null}, "id": "file_0000000029d4