aration;\n- frozen/later-superseded hotel-calendar logic;\n- health separation;\n- Vegas state should update only on actual transactions.\n\nIntake 006 adds a more specific evidence-backed MGM promotion layer and a dated Personal Operations package.\n\n### Reconciliation result\n**Keep Intake 002 and Intake 006 separately.**\n\n- **Intake 002:** Vegas liquidity/calendar closeout lineage.\n- **Intake 006:** broader Personal Operations package + MGM promotional-rule reconciliation + Playa contact lineage.\n\nNeither replaces the other wholesale.\n\n## G. Artifact map\n\nImportant artifacts recorded here:\n\n- `PERSONAL_OPERATIONS_HANDOFF_2026-09-07.zip` — historical/supporting snapshot.\n- Internal files `00_READ_ME_FIRST.md` through `12_NEW_CHAT_BOOTSTRAP_PROMPT.md`.\n- `temporary_workout_plan.docx`.\n- **Vegas Itinerary — Living Plan and Cash Flow — September 2026** — Drive.\n- **Vegas Food, Exercise, and Daily Rhythm — Living Plan** — Drive.\n- **Post-Vegas Travel Options — Living Plan** — Drive.\n- Daphne/Jason correspondence — supporting contact evidence. fileciteturn4file0L234-L317\n\n**Drive recon:** queued only. No mutation.\n\n## H–M. Disposition\n\nThe reusable Framework-level observations—projected vs realized value, delta artifacts not necessarily restating parent entitlement, and stale-state supersession without provenance destruction—remain **reconciliation candidates/supporting evidence**, not new canon. fileciteturn4file0L323-L340\n\n**FINAL DISPOSITION:**  \n**KEEP Personal Operations principles; preserve Sep-7 package as provenance; retain MGM rules as project-current only to the extent supported by that source evidence; preserve Daphne contact state; supersede stale balances/calendar/timing assumptions.**\n\n---\n\n# INTAKE 007 — Historical Framework Architecture / Kimi Seat / EC⁸ Split\n\n## A. Chat identity\n\n**Workstream:** GCE Framework Reconciliation → Kimi Seat Validation → Architecture Closeout → EC⁸ separation → Model Test Harness  