n as an exploratory \\\"part of the ship, part of the crew\\\" model audition during an Edge Crew discussion. It became a useful controlled proving ground for model behavior, labor specialization, contamination control, provider/runtime reliability, and stage discipline.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nIMPORTANT BOUNDARY\\r\\nBlack Pearl is not an Edge Crew project branch and is not a new GCE project.\\r\\nIt is framework research evidence produced from a bounded domain test.\\r\\nProject-specific implementation truth remains inside the relevant project.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nTRIAL 01 METHOD\\r\\n- one sparse, frozen MLB pregame packet\\r\\n- same bounded evidence to independent first-pass models\\r\\n- explicit missing markers\\r\\n- no browsing or outside factual supplementation\\r\\n- Don prior withheld from models\\r\\n- purpose: observe reasoning behavior under uncertainty, not choose a betting winner\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nMAJOR FINDINGS\\r\\n1. The useful question was not \\\"which model is best?\\\" but \\\"what job does each model naturally perform?\\\"\\r\\n2. Distinct jobs emerged: grounded analyst, skeptic, pattern analyst, anomaly hunter, cross-examiner, methodology challenger, verifier, integrator.\\r\\n3. Different vendors can still share priors; independence must be measured by evidence/driver/reasoning overlap, not assumed from model names.\\r\\n4. Provider/runtime reliability materially affects operational value.\\r\\n5. Central gatekeeping is less attractive than distributed grounding, challenge, verification, and explicit integration.\\r\\n6. Sparse first reads can reveal model behavior that a maximum-data packet may hide.\\r\\n7. Architecture models can prematurely harden an unfinished POC if stage is not declared.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nSTAGE LESSON\\r\\nPOC / Discovery -> Design -> Architecture -> Validation -> Production\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nAn architect model should not decide what an unfinished POC means before Don/Coda explicitly promote the work into architecture.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRELATIONSHIP TO EXISTING GCE\\r\\nBlack Pearl supplies empirical evidence for existing Aegis / Capo / GCE instincts around specialization, provenance, convergence, capability-vs-authority, verification, and controlled promotion. It does not supersede those anchors.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPROMOTION RULE\\r\\nKeep raw experiment evidence here.\\r\\nMove only generalized, reviewed lessons into Model Labor Intelligence, Runtime/Provider Intelligence, Cross-Project Methodology Research, or Strategic Governance standards.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPROJECTS\\r\\nDo not modify or duplicate project-owned artifacts from this research lane. Projects may hand evidence upward; framework reconciles it outside Projects.\"}]},\"error\":null,\"error_data\":null,\"error_code\":null,\"classification_id\":null,\"json_rpc_error_code\":null,\"error_http_status_code\":null,\"error_http_headers\":null,\"internal\":{\"external_call_time_ms\":1174},\"clamp_errors\":null,\"clamp_rewrites\":null,\"connector_id\":\"connector_5f3c8c41a1e54ad7a76272c89e2554fa\",\"connector_name\":\"Google Drive\",\"action_name\":\"search\",\"is_sync\":false}"}, "create_time": 1790199313.2063222, "end_turn": null, "id": "5a1072cb-e97d-40cb-83ba-b6717de8a536", "metadata": {"can_save": false, "chime_version": 1, "classifier_response": "default", "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "gizmo_id": "g-p-6ab43fca21d0819183966405a724bf5d", "invoked_plugin": {}, "invoked_resource": {"api_tool_version": "v2", "app_name": "Google Drive", "contains_mcp_source": false, "description": "Search Google Drive and return file or folder metadata. Calls without `item_type` and `page_token` retain the legacy search and optional best-effort text hydration. An explicit `image`, `document`, or `folder` item type searches exactly one metadata-only provider page; it never fetches file contents, even with `best_effort_fetch=True`. Return the opaque, provider-owned `next_page_token` unchanged as the next request's `page_toke