document\",\"size\":\"4471\",\"file_or_folder\":\"file\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-07T19:33:48.748Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-16T21:39:24.558Z\",\"viewedByMeTime\":\"2026-09-16T21:39:24.558Z\",\"display_title\":\"README — Personal Operating Context Index\",\"display_url\":\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ck6Q0XG_8ZSI9feHdq5AqZq298GB7M5Q4swkE9cu6RI/edit?usp=drivesdk\",\"parent_ids\":[\"1HWN3CKJrtZExf9IcCmlKakv_HcDFtFqn\"],\"shared\":false,\"content\":\"﻿Personal Operating Context — Index and Operating Profile\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPurpose\\r\\nThis is the living personal-context layer for working with Peter across budgeting, travel, family, relocation, career transitions, personal systems, preferences, and decision-making. It is not a diary and not a therapy file. It exists so AI collaborators can understand who they are working with, preserve continuity, distinguish facts from interpretation, and give advice that fits Peter's actual operating style.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nOperating principle\\r\\nContext should improve judgment without replacing Peter's authority. Store evidence, chronology, preferences, constraints, repeated patterns, and explicitly stated meaning. Avoid flattening Peter into labels. Preserve the distinction between what Peter said, what was observed, and what is inferred.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCurrent structure\\r\\n00_Index_and_Operating_Profile — map, operating rules, current-state summaries, cross-links.\\r\\n01_Chronology_Identity_and_Personality_Gate — chronological context, formative experiences, personality/archetype tests, personal meaning, working-style observations.\\r\\n02_Vegas_Budget_Loyalty_and_Parachute — Vegas cash flow, lodging, MGM/Hard Rock/Palms strategy, offer mechanics, tier-credit analysis, emergency-parachute logic.\\r\\n03_Mexico_Family_and_Relocation — Playa del Carmen move, family priorities, infrastructure, concierge relationships, residence/logistics planning.\\r\\n04_Relationships_Contacts_and_Followups — important personal contacts, follow-ups, action items, and relationship context needed for execution.\\r\\n05_Personal_Systems_Preferences_and_Test_Cases — decision patterns, personal operating methods, model-interaction preferences, music/simple-balance context, test cases used to validate AI understanding.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nExisting living files reviewed and retained in place\\r\\n- Vegas Itinerary — Living Plan and Cash Flow — September 2026.\\r\\n- Vegas Food, Exercise, and Daily Rhythm — Living Plan.\\r\\n- Post-Vegas Travel Options — Living Plan.\\r\\n- Get Back to Family — Mexico Work Infrastructure — Living Plan.\\r\\n- Job Search Status & Interview Prep remains the work/career source and should be cross-referenced, not duplicated into personal context.\\r\\n- CasaCompanion and Simple Balance remain separate existing branches; this context layer may reference them but should not restructure them without explicit approval.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCurrent personal decision order\\r\\n1. Protect continuous lodging, food, liquidity, and communications.\\r\\n2. Advance the director/principal-level job transition and income runway.\\r\\n3. Protect and improve the AI/GCE operating system at low incremental cost.\\r\\n4. Move toward family-centered life in Mexico.\\r\\n5. Use recovery, entertainment, casino offers, music, walking, and travel only in ways that do not damage the first four.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nWorking style with AI\\r\\nPeter treats high-level models as partners/advisors, expects independent judgment, and explicitly wants pushback when warranted. He speaks quickly, often nonlinearly, and may open multiple threads before closing them. The model should reconstruct the thread, classify updates into the correct bucket, and avoid making Peter repeat context that already exists. Peter values evidence, systems thinking, ROI, leverage, contingency design, and testable hypotheses. Slang such as 'gaming the system' often means optimizing within published rules rather than deception.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nEvidence discipline\\r\\n- Confirmed cash, refunds, holds, offers, dates, and contact responses are facts.\\r\\n- Free play, expected repayments, anticipated refunds, and future income remain $0 in the base budget until actually available.\\r\\n- Casino status is an option/value layer, not a reason to chase spend.\\r\\n- Personal stories and archetype comparisons can be operationally relevant when Peter explicitly uses them to explain values, identity, decision patterns, or how an advisor should interpret him.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nLatest session anchor\\r\\nSee: 2026-09-07 — Personality Gate and Personal Chronology — Session Capture.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n2026-09-07 operating additions\\r\\n- Privacy naming: use Beppi for Peter's wife; use 'my son' for Peter's child unless Peter explicitly authorizes another label.\\r\\n- Personal compute shorthand: CPU = active thinking load; RAM = open loops/concurrent tasks; battery = physical state; bandwidth = emotional/environmental capacity. Use this model to assess whether to deep-dive, simplify, or close loops.\\r\\n- Personality gate now includes Joker/chaos archetype work and music-based interpretation with source-context preservation.\\r\\n- Relationship/family context must distinguish Peter's communication rhythm from Beppi's rather than assuming one household operating style.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n2026-09-07 session-close update\\r\\n- The Personality Gate / Personal Chronology session capture now includes a full Music / Live-Events / Career Artifact Expansion covering Warren Zevon interpretation, CID Entertainment, Players/WMC, Simple/Balance at Treehouse Miami, mentorship/intern development, festival-consulting retainer lessons, and the direct through-line into Combined 365 and Peter's current ERP-first / AI-as-leverage career model.\\r\\n- Core durable synthesis: music is a protected operating language and grounding system, not Peter's primary economic engine; knowledge should be shared; expertise should be priced; ownership/authority must be explicit; strong signal detection must be paired with governance; winning a game and choosing a game are different decisions; the current framework externalizes operating principles Peter has lived for decades.\\r\\n- Ordinary operational sessions should not reopen these stories unless Peter explicitly asks. Use them as background context for judgment, especially around risk, scope, mentorship, ownership, career fit, and simple balance\\r\\nCURRENT PERSONAL CHAT BOOTSTRAP\\r\\n- Primary live Vegas source: “Vegas Budget, Hotel Timeline & Liquidity Anchor.” Its newest afternoon handoff is authoritative for current cash, hotel holds, refunds, credits, and lodging sequence.\\r\\n- New personal chats should load the living Vegas anchor rather than reconstructing prior hotel math from chat history.\\r\\n- Preserve the evidence discipline: hard cash first; each pending authorization separately; expected inflows only after that; non-cash casino/hotel value kept separate.\\r\\n- Current execution principle: multiple things can remain mentally active, but only one job should be in Peter’s hands at a time. Externalize the rest into visible artifacts so they do not need to stay in working memory.\"}]},\"error\":null,\"error_data\":null,\"error_code\":null,\"classification_id\":null,\"json_rpc_error_code\":null,\"error_http_status_code\":null,\"error_http_headers\":null,\"internal\":{\"external_call_time_ms\":1317},\"clamp_errors\":null,\"clamp_rewrites\":null,\"connector_id\":\"connector_5f3c8c41a1e54ad7a76272c89e2554fa\",\"connector_name\":\"Google Drive\",\"action_name\":\"search\",\"is_sync\":false}"}, "create_time": 1790199320.549442, "end_turn": null, "id": "4295b2b1-8bb3-4fc5-9473-65093021a695", "metadata": {"can_save": false, "chime_version": 1, "classifier_response": "default", "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "gizmo_id": "g-p-6ab43fca21d0819183966405a724bf5d", "invoked_plugin": {}, "invoked_resou