ut\n\n[L15] **Original objective:** establish a weekly orientation and claim-ready outreach list for the active ERP + AI job search.\n\n[L17] **Major pivots:**\n\n[L19] - Reconstructed, deduplicated, and marked completed recruiter/employer outreach for the unemployment claim.\n[L20] - Shifted from generic job-search activity into precise positioning for the Myers-Holum Principal Consultant final interview.\n[L21] - Developed the role language around SuiteSuccess, sales/solution-architecture handoff, lifecycle ownership, governance, and commercial health.\n[L22] - Added Oasis Solutions as a meaningful parallel Principal Consultant opportunity.\n[L23] - Reclassified ATEX/Apex as relationship maintenance rather than the primary career target.\n\n[L25] **Final scope:** a focused Principal Consultant job-search lane, with MHI as the primary process, Oasis as a parallel contender, and clear interview/offer evaluation criteria.\n\n[L27] ## 3. Accomplishments by Date\n\n[L29] ### September 6, 2026\n\n[L31] **WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:** Created the recurring weekly ERP + AI job-search orientation.  \n[L32] **DECISION / RESULT:** Weekly brief will prioritize interviews, recruiter follow-ups, decisions, prep, stalls, deadlines, and three highest-value actions.  \n[L33] **WHO / WHICH SEAT OWNED IT:** Don / Coda  \n[L34] **STATUS:** implemented\n\n[L36] ### September 8, 2026\n\n[L38] **WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:** Built and cleaned the unemployment-claim outreach list.  \n[L39] **DECISION / RESULT:** Prior completed contacts were separated from new claimable activity. Core contacts included recruiter/employer threads such as Jeremy Lowell, Kevin Frater, Ryan Case, Megan H./Planet Group, SystemsAccountants, SpringPoint, and Anderson Frank.  \n[L40] **WHO / WHICH SEAT OWNED IT:** Don / Coda  \n[L41] **STATUS:** accepted\n\n[L43] ### September 8, 2026\n\n[L45] **WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:** Clarified the ATEX interview roster and company context.  \n[L46] **DECISION / RESULT:** ATEX was ident