sappeared**.\n\n[L78] The remaining source-of-truth action became confirmation with MGM VIP/Casino Services/Cosmo rather than guessing from the modification email.\n\n[L80] **WHO / WHICH SEAT OWNED IT:** Don.\n\n[L82] **STATUS:** accepted\n\n---\n\n[L86] ## DATE: 2026-09-23 — PROMOTIONAL PLANNING BASELINE\n\n[L88] **WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:** Don tested a newly received Excalibur offer against the booking system and observed that the promotional inventory/offer would not simply produce another equivalent promotional booking while an offer was already allocated.\n\n[L90] **DECISION / RESULT:** Budgeting was grounded conservatively: do **not** count multiple $270 FREEPLAY awards. Resort-credit treatment remained subject to the particular offer/resort and MGM confirmation.\n\n[L92] **WHO / WHICH SEAT OWNED IT:** Don.\n\n[L94] **STATUS:** accepted\n\n---\n\n[L98] ## DATE: 2026-09-23 — NUTRITION SHOPPING\n\n[L100] **WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:** Multiple low-cost nutrition/supplement candidates were examined, including greens powders, mushroom blends, vitamin products, sea-vegetable powder, and MCT oil.\n\n[L102] **DECISION / RESULT:** The working objective remained filling actual nutritional gaps cheaply rather than buying supplements because of marketing claims. Greens/whole-food powders and sea vegetables were considered more aligned with the identified nutritional objective than mushroom-only blends or MCT oil.\n\n[L104] **WHO / WHICH SEAT OWNED IT:** Don decision-making with Coda analysis.\n\n[L106] **STATUS:** proposed/supporting; no universal supplement protocol was canonized.\n\n---\n\n[L110] ## DATE: 2026-09-23 — PLAYA RELOCATION APPEND\n\n[L112] **WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:** The Jason Baibokas → Daphne Magna introduction thread was ingested into the Personal Operations context.\n\n[L114] **DECISION / RESULT:** Daphne became a live supporting relocation contact for neighborhood selection, apartment search, and relocation logistics. Gladys' involvement in apartment selecti