malization | Claude 3 Haiku | 3,000 | 500 | $0.00440 |\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n### Per-Run / Per-Slate / Daily\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n| Period | Cost |\\r\\n|--------|------|\\r\\n| Per full run (26 calls) | **$0.34951** |\\r\\n| Per slate (53 calls) | **$0.71022** |\\r\\n| Per day (15 games) | **$10.65** |\\r\\n| Per month (30d × 15g) | **$319.60** |\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n---\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n## 11. Cost Comparison Summary\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n| Metric | Profile A (Cost) | Profile B (Balanced) | Profile C (Max-Q) |\\r\\n|--------|-----------------|---------------------|-------------------|\\r\\n| Per run (26 calls) | $0.112 | $0.198 | $0.350 |\\r\\n| Per slate (53 calls) | $0.224 | $0.397 | $0.710 |\\r\\n| Per day (15 games) | $3.36 | $5.95 | $10.65 |\\r\\n| Per month (15g/day) | $100.86 | $178.48 | $319.60 |\\r\\n| Highest-cost stage | Analyst E re-analysis | Analyst E re-analysis | Analyst A (Claude) re-analysis |\\r\\n| Highest-cost model | Nova Pro ($0.80/$3.20) | Nova Pro ($0.80/$3.20) | Claude 3.5 Sonnet v2 ($3/$15) |\\r\\n| Cheapest viable sub for highest | Mistral Small 24B ($0.08/$0.24) | Mistral Small 24B | Mistral Large 3 ($0.50/$1.50) |\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n---\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n## 12. Bedrock vs Direct-Provider Routing Map\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n| Route | Provider | Via Bedrock? | Rationale |\\r\\n|-------|----------|-------------|-----------|\\r\\n| Amazon Nova (Micro/Lite/Pro) | Amazon | YES | Native Bedrock, no alternative |\\r\\n| Anthropic Claude (Haiku/Sonnet) | Anthropic | YES | Bedrock primary; direct API as fallback for latency |\\r\\n| Meta Llama 3.3 70B | Meta | YES | On Bedrock; also available via direct (Together/Fireworks) but Bedrock preferred for single gateway |\\r\\n| Mistral (Small/Large) | Mistral | YES | On Bedrock; direct API (La Plateforme) as fallback |\\r\\n| DeepSeek v3.2 | DeepSeek | YES | On Bedrock us-east; direct API as fallback |\\r\\n| MiniMax M2.5 | MiniMax | YES | On Bedrock us-east; direct API as fallback |\\r\\n| Google Gemma 3 27B | Google | YES | 