_at\":\"2026-09-21T19:18:29.852Z\",\"viewedByMeTime\":\"2026-09-21T19:18:29.852Z\",\"display_title\":\"GCE_FRAMEWORK_HANDOFF_2026-09-21_MAIN_CHAT_RECONCILIATION\",\"display_url\":\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1SXR_CaZs2r1_xjBl2_Dyg7mNsgFWojajt46PbrRWnFw/edit?usp=drivesdk\",\"parent_ids\":[\"1clV7UUxQUcnGLX21ossOWoHGBPs-pM77\"],\"shared\":false,\"content\":\"﻿GCE FRAMEWORK HANDOFF — MAIN CHAT RECONCILIATION\\r\\nDate: 2026-09-21\\r\\nSeat: Coda — Strategic Advisor / Governance\\r\\nPurpose: clean handoff from the long-running main framework chat into the new framework conversation\\r\\nStatus: CHECKPOINT / READY FOR CONTINUATION\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n1. AUTHORITY / IDENTITY DOCTRINE\\r\\n- IDENTITY != ROLE != LENS != PERSONALITY != AUTHORITY != MODEL.\\r\\n- MODEL != SEAT.\\r\\n- Don is final authority.\\r\\n- Seats retain stable organizational identity; model/runtime occupants remain replaceable.\\r\\n- Capability does not grant authority.\\r\\n- Coda owns governance, boundaries, canon/supersession, cross-seat reconciliation, and Don decision framing.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n2. DRIVE / ORGANIZATIONAL BOUNDARY\\r\\nCanonical root remains:\\r\\nGCE/\\r\\n- GCE_ORG\\r\\n- 03_Projects\\r\\n- 06_Frozen_State_and_Archive\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nHard boundary for this framework conversation:\\r\\n- Do not modify 03_Projects from framework reconciliation.\\r\\n- Projects own project truth and current implementation artifacts.\\r\\n- Framework receives project handoffs/evidence and extracts only reusable cross-project lessons outside Projects.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n3. NEW TECHNICAL STRATEGY RESEARCH LANES CREATED 2026-09-21\\r\\nUnder GCE_ORG / Executive Council / Technical Strategy / Systems Intelligence:\\r\\n- 01_Model_Labor_Intelligence\\r\\n- 02_Runtime_Provider_Intelligence\\r\\n- 03_Proving_Grounds\\r\\n- 04_Cross_Project_Methodology_Research\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nThese are non-project framework research surfaces.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n4. BLACK PEARL / MODEL LAB\\r\\nBlack Pearl was a bounded proving-ground experiment, not a new project.\\r\\nIt used a sparse frozen MLB packet to observe model behavior under uncertainty.\\r\\nPrimary outcome was a model labor map, not a model leaderboard.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nObserved role fits:\\r\\n- GPT-5.6 Sol: bounded senior analyst\\r\\n- Nex N2.5 Pro: grounded skeptic\\r\\n- Muse Spark 1.3: pattern analyst\\r\\n- Dots3: anomaly hunter\\r\\n- Grok 4.6: contradiction cross-examiner\\r\\n- Kimi K3 High: methodology challenger\\r\\n- Big Pickle: verifier / truth teller\\r\\n- GLM 5.1 / 5.3-class: architecture / integration\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nRaw research remains Technical Strategy evidence. Any seat/canon change requires separate governance promotion.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n5. RUNTIME / PROVIDER LESSONS\\r\\n- Cognitive suitability != operational suitability.\\r\\n- Route reliability, latency, rate limits, host, context continuity, and tool/file reliability matter separately.\\r\\n- Heavy stateful work should avoid silent model/runtime substitution mid-flight.\\r\\n- Kimi 2.7 high-speed stall vs K3-2-256K recovery and Big Pickle stateful takeover are retained as operating evidence.\\r\\n- Provider/runtime identity must not be confused with seat identity.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n6. CROSS-PROJECT METHODOLOGY LESSONS\\r\\nCandidate reusable laws:\\r\\n- POC / Discovery -> Design -> Architecture -> Validation -> Production.\\r\\n- Do not let an architect define an unfinished POC before explicit promotion.\\r\\n- Independence before convergence.\\r\\n- Preserve disagreement and provenance.\\r\\n- Verification != adjudication != final authority.\\r\\n- Different models/providers do not automatically create independent evidence.\\r\\n- Prefer progressive evidence where it improves signal.\\r\\n- Add persistent layers only when repeated operating need earns them.\\r\\n- Harden from real defects surgically rather than over-engineering hypothetical failures.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n7. RELATIONSHIP TO AEGIS / CAPO\\r\\nBlack Pearl does not create a competing architecture.\\r\\nIt provides empirical evidence for existing GCE/Aegis/Capo principles:\\r\\n- specialize / parallelize / converge\\r\\n- capability != authority\\r\\n- preserve provenance\\r\\n- controlled promotion\\r\\n- stage-gated verification\\r\\n- operator retains commitment authority\\r\\nAegis and Capo remain scoped/parked per their existing anchors unless separately promoted.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n8. PROJECT RECONCILIATION RULE\\r\\nProject does work -> project owns current truth -> project returns handoff/evidence -> framework reconciles outside Projects -> Technical Strategy extracts reusable method -> Strategic Governance decides canon/standard promotion.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nDo not overwrite project artifacts from the framework chat.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n9. EDGE CREW CONTEXT — ONLY WHAT FRAMEWORK NEEDS\\r\\nThe long chat temporarily used Edge Crew as a proving ground and generated useful framework lessons. Edge Crew implementation truth is intentionally not restated here.\\r\\nWhen needed, consume the latest project handoff and reconcile only the generalized lesson.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n10. DRIVE ARTIFACTS CURRENT AS OF THIS HANDOFF\\r\\nStrategic Governance:\\r\\n- GCE_GOOGLE_DRIVE_STRUCTURE_MANIFEST_CURRENT_2026-09-21\\r\\n- this handoff\\r\\n- existing Aegis / Capo anchors remain active scoping references\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nTechnical Strategy:\\r\\n- GCE_MODEL_LABOR_INTELLIGENCE_CURRENT_2026-09-21\\r\\n- GCE_RUNTIME_PROVIDER_INTELLIGENCE_CURRENT_2026-09-21\\r\\n- GCE_BLACK_PEARL_MODEL_LAB_RESEARCH_ANCHOR_2026-09-21\\r\\n- GCE_CROSS_PROJECT_METHODOLOGY_RESEARCH_CURRENT_2026-09-21\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n11. NEW CHAT OPENING INSTRUCTION\\r\\nLoad this handoff as the framework continuation anchor.\\r\\nDo not redesign the framework from scratch.\\r\\nFirst distinguish VERIFIED CURRENT STATE, RESEARCH EVIDENCE, PROPOSED DOCTRINE, and PROJECT-OWNED TRUTH.\\r\\nKeep Projects read-only unless Don explicitly opens a project reconciliation task.\\r\\nResume from the single highest-priority framework blocker or decision in front of Don.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nSTATUS: PROCEED\\r\\nCONFIDENCE: 97%\\r\\nREASON: the long main chat has been decomposed into framework research and governance artifacts without modifying project-owned work.\\r\\nNEXT GATE: new framework chat consumes this handoff; any project-specific update enters only through an explicit handoff/reconciliation step.\\r\\nDON INPUT NEEDED: No for continuity; Yes only for a material canon/authority change.\"}]},\"error\":null,\"error_data\":null,\"error_code\":null,\"classification_id\":null,\"json_rpc_error_code\":null,\"error_http_status_code\":null,\"error_http_headers\":null,\"internal\":{\"external_call_time_ms\":1291},\"clamp_errors\":null,\"clamp_rewrites\":null,\"connector_id\":\"connector_5f3c8c41a1e54ad7a76272c89e2554fa\",\"connector_name\":\"Google Drive\",\"action_name\":\"search\",\"is_sync\":false}"}, "create_time": 1790199308.8628244, "end_turn": null, "id": "d114533f-1ee0-42a2-b366-316636364128", "metadata": {"can_save": false, "chime_version": 1, "classifier_response": "default", "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "gizmo_id": "g-p-6ab43fca21d0819183966405a724bf5d", "invoked_plugin": {}, "invoked_resource": {"api_tool_version": "v2", "app_name": "Google Drive", "contains_mcp_source": false, "description": "Search Google Drive and return file or folder metadata. Calls without `item_type` and `page_token` retain the legacy search and optional best-effort text hydration. An explicit `image`, `document`, or `folder` item type searches exactly one metadata-only provider page; it never fetches file contents, even with `best_effort_fetch=True`. Return the opaque, provider-owned `next_page_token` unchanged as the next request's `page_token`, including when a page has no allowed results. Use short, specific keywords, or omit the query to browse accessible files. Broaden an empty-result search with related terms, abbreviations, or synonyms. `special_fil