google.com/document/d/1hsHvlCqilEYt_aYPiyb7ywCkJarjADn9fKzzkSK383c/edit?usp=drivesdk\",\"title\":\"GCE_CROSS_PROJECT_METHODOLOGY_RESEARCH_CURRENT_2026-09-21\",\"id\":\"1hsHvlCqilEYt_aYPiyb7ywCkJarjADn9fKzzkSK383c\",\"mime_type\":\"application/vnd.google-apps.document\",\"size\":\"2057\",\"file_or_folder\":\"file\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-21T19:17:18.818Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-21T19:18:26.316Z\",\"viewedByMeTime\":\"2026-09-21T19:18:26.316Z\",\"display_title\":\"GCE_CROSS_PROJECT_METHODOLOGY_RESEARCH_CURRENT_2026-09-21\",\"display_url\":\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hsHvlCqilEYt_aYPiyb7ywCkJarjADn9fKzzkSK383c/edit?usp=drivesdk\",\"parent_ids\":[\"19s_Be2IuvOU_Ue3pFTpv0MuiwTwLsJpf\"],\"shared\":false,\"content\":\"﻿GCE CROSS-PROJECT METHODOLOGY RESEARCH — CURRENT\\r\\nDate: 2026-09-21\\r\\nOwner: Technical Strategy / Systems Intelligence\\r\\nStatus: RESEARCH CURRENT — candidate framework lessons pending governance promotion\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPURPOSE\\r\\nCapture methods that appear reusable across projects without importing project-specific implementation logic into the framework.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nCURRENT CANDIDATE LESSONS\\r\\n- Stage-match the model to the work: discovery is not design; design is not architecture; architecture is not validation.\\r\\n- Do not let an architecture model define an unfinished POC before the work is explicitly promoted.\\r\\n- Independence before convergence.\\r\\n- Preserve provenance and disagreement rather than averaging them away.\\r\\n- Verification and decision authority are separate.\\r\\n- Capability != authority.\\r\\n- Shared evidence does not imply shared conclusion.\\r\\n- Model/provider diversity does not automatically equal epistemic independence.\\r\\n- Use progressive evidence where appropriate: bounded first read -> disagreement/blocker discovery -> targeted evidence expansion -> challenge/verification -> decision surface.\\r\\n- Avoid adding permanent layers before repeated operating need earns them.\\r\\n- Prefer surgical hardening from real failures over speculative hardening of every possible failure mode.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPROJECT-TO-FRAMEWORK RECONCILIATION\\r\\nProject does the work.\\r\\nProject owns current implementation truth.\\r\\nProject returns evidence / handoff.\\r\\nFramework reviews outside the project estate.\\r\\nTechnical Strategy extracts reusable method.\\r\\nStrategic Governance decides whether the method becomes standard/canon.\\r\\nHistorical project evidence remains provenance and is not silently rewritten.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nNON-GOAL\\r\\nThis document does not define Edge Crew, Aegis, Capo, Casa Companion, or any other project. It records reusable methodology candidates only.\"}]},\"error\":null,\"error_data\":null,\"error_code\":null,\"classification_id\":null,\"json_rpc_error_code\":null,\"error_http_status_code\":null,\"error_http_headers\":null,\"internal\":{\"external_call_time_ms\":1323},\"clamp_errors\":null,\"clamp_rewrites\":null,\"connector_id\":\"connector_5f3c8c41a1e54ad7a76272c89e2554fa\",\"connector_name\":\"Google Drive\",\"action_name\":\"search\",\"is_sync\":false}"}, "create_time": 1790199311.941434, "end_turn": null, "id": "650ed801-455f-4b21-a043-beebd180493d", "metadata": {"can_save": false, "chime_version": 1, "classifier_response": "default", "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "gizmo_id": "g-p-6ab43fca21d0819183966405a724bf5d", "invoked_plugin": {}, "invoked_resource": {"api_tool_version": "v2", "app_name": "Google Drive", "contains_mcp_source": false, "description": "Search Google Drive and return file or folder metadata. Calls without `item_type` and `page_token` retain the legacy search and optional best-effort text hydration. An explicit `image`, `document`, or `folder` item type searches exactly one metadata-only provider page; it never fetches file contents, even with `best_effort_fetch=True`. Return the opaque, provider-owned `next_page_token` unchanged as the next request's `page_toke