liation Project itself was intentional\n\nThis is huge for provenance.\n\nThe source records that Don/Coda deliberately created:\n\n- the **Universal Chat Closeout / Recap** process;\n- the **GCE Framework Reconciliation Project**;\n- stale-chat lane classification;\n- artifact mapping;\n- read-only Drive reconciliation;\n- cumulative historical registry. fileciteturn37file0L261-L283\n\nSo what we are doing now is not an improvised cleanup. It is the execution of the intended next phase.\n\n---\n\n# Revised Wave-2 action ledger\n\nAfter this final record, the live list is now:\n\n1. **Framework taxonomy + frozen-seat migration verification**\n   - verify planned migration actually executed;\n   - verify router/identity/Command Center/VoiceBridge/mailroom/project-route surfaces;\n   - distinguish functional taxonomy from stale seat-era naming;\n   - preserve historical folders/artifacts.\n\n2. **Model Test Case index / working artifact**\n   - Disney;\n   - Monitor harness;\n   - Kimi/EC⁸ real-world validation;\n   - Black Pearl;\n   - pointer/index only, no duplication.\n\n3. **Job Search cleanup**\n   - already owned by separate live chat;\n   - inherit latest RF-SMART third-interview state.\n\n4. **Vegas calendar final-state check**\n   - resolve Fontainebleau 10/12–10/15 vs later dropped-state memory.\n\n5. **Current Framework validation — later**\n   - only after this reconciliation project has enough coverage;\n   - this source explicitly says stale-chat recon comes first. fileciteturn37file0L623-L657\n\n6. **Proton cleanup/unlink**\n   - separate operational work item;\n   - not part of Framework reconciliation. fileciteturn37file0L661-L669\n\n## Closed / no longer open\n\n- Frozen roster — **closed**\n- Kimi as operating seat — **superseded**\n- Calibro as current implementation-design seat — **superseded**\n- Corrado as general technical advisor — **superseded**\n- GCE Stack scope — **confirmed**\n- Historical naming policy — **confirmed**\n- Reconciliation-project purpose — **confirmed**\n\n---\n\n# Wave 2 checkpoint\n\n**Wave 2 now has 4 records.**\n\nThis final source materially improves the whole reconciliation because it gives us the **authoritative transition point** from the old Framework into:\n\n**frozen roster → seat-migration planning → GCE Stack split → stale-chat reconciliation project.**\n\nSo yes — **this was the one I did not have before**, and now Wave 2 is complete enough to pause cleanly.\n\n**STATUS:** CHECKPOINT  \n**CONFIDENCE:** **99%**  \n**NEXT FRAMEWORK PRIORITY:** taxonomy + seat-migration verification  \n**DON INPUT NEEDED NOW:** **NO**  \n**ANCHOR:** Wave 1 baseline + Wave 2 four-record update are now reconciled."]}, "create_time": 1790200832.802357, "end_turn": true, "id": "1a8412b2-1415-4074-9c9b-07cd6c730b06", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [{"citation_format_type": "berry_file_search", "end_ix": 659, "metadata": {"extra": {"api_tool_source": "files/context_stuff", "authors_display": null, "cited_message_id": "1ed8831f-5cd3-4c89-a2b0-5e4fbd49fea0", "cited_message_idx": 407, "cloud_doc_url": null, "doi": null, "effective_time": null, "journal_homepage_url": null, "journal_name": null, "library_file_id": "libfile_4609c168b15881918809bc8517b1cd17", "line_range": [24, 58], "publication_year": null, "retrieval_file_index": 0, "retrieval_turn": 37, "run_id": null, "search_result_idx": null, "set_id": null, "source_icon_url": null, "source_label": null, "source_url": null, "spl_version": null, "title": null}, "id": "file_00000000264081fd97a6d53379af47e2", "name": "Pasted text.txt", "source": "my_files", "text": "# 2. WHAT THIS CHAT WAS ACTUALLY ABOUT\n## Original objective\nThe chat began as the **restart of the main GCE Framework conversation** from a clean 2026-09-20 handoff. That handoff explicitly separated Framework from Edge Crew, re-established **MODEL != SEAT**, preserved stable authority, and instructed the new conversation to reconstruct current truth before r